# U24: allflame_exp_001 (1280x800 coordinates, default zoom): the node tooltips with stat differences through
# the calc: an allocated mastery (Unallocating, gold, runegraft tip), an allocated notable with a dependent
# (the depends diff), an allocated jewel socket (the AddItemTooltip stand-in, the right click tip), an
# unallocated socket (threshold jewel lines), an unallocated keystone (Allocating + path diff, reminder and
# flavour text), an unallocated mastery (the mastery options list), a cluster subgraph node (expansion
# node, no tattoo tip), the allocated runegraft, an allocated keystone and Ctrl+C on it (Copy), then Ctrl+D
# (no stat differences) and a SHIFT trace hover.
screen 1280 800
